  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed new project entitles &apos;Action on Climate and Trade&apos; will be implemented by the WEF in partnership with the WTO &amp; World Bank Group. The project aims to build the capacity of Ministries of Trade in developing countries and LDC&apos;s to integrate a climate change dimension into trade strategies and to integrate trade issues into NDC (Nationally Determined Contributions (NDCs) updates and National Adaption Plans</narrative>
